{"text":{"en":{"캠 플로워 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"Cam Follower Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Cam Followers</p> <h2>캠 플로워 베어링</h2> <p>샤프트 역할을 하는 스터드(Stud)의 머리 부분에 니들 롤러 베어링이 결합되어 있는 형태로, 자동화 기계, 각종 운반 장치, 머시닝 센터의 공구 교환 장치 등 다양한 용도로 사용됩니다.</p> <p>CF(미터 나사)·CR(인치 나사) 계열로 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Cam Followers</p> <h2>Cam Follower Bearings</h2> <p>A needle roller bearing is mounted on the head of a stud that functions as a shaft. They are used in a wide range of applications such as automation machinery, various conveying equipment, and tool-changing devices in machining centers.</p> <p>Available in the CF (metric thread) and CR (inch thread) series.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just the part number or part of the dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/cam_follower.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">나사(d,G) · D · C · B1</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/cam_follower.png\" alt=\"Cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">Thread(d,G) · D · C · B1</p>","<label for=\"cfwFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"cfwFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: CF10 또는 M10X1.25\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"cfwFilter\">Part Number / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"cfwFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. CF10 or M10X1.25\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"cfwCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"cfwToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p cl